  "2026-07-27T23:31:48.117Z","harness:codex","Final verification evidence: lint, zero-warning static quality, TypeScript checking, contracts, docs/skills, context evaluation, secret scanning, and dependency audit passed. Full sandboxed coverage passed 380 files and 6,436 tests at exactly 100% statements (44,686/44,686), branches (31,786/31,786), functions (9,153/9,153), and lines (43,399/43,399). A packed tarball installed in a fresh unrelated consumer resolved its own CLI for npm/npx/bunx, completed init/create/claim/update/lean-output/health/validate/merge-install flows, and exercised the real Git merge driver across independent branches. Live repository health has zero warnings and authoritative history validation reports 0 missing, unreadable, hash-mismatch, or chain-mismatch streams."
  "2026-07-28T00:03:25.675Z","harness:codex","Review round 1: Greptile identified that a custom type folder named history/schema/search/extensions/locks could demote structural health requirements. Health now distinguishes built-in item folders from structural core folders and a HistoryAlias collision regression proves missing history remains required."
  "2026-07-28T00:12:07.529Z","harness:codex","Review round 1 terminal verification: focused SDK/CLI/history regressions, typecheck, lint, zero-duplicate/static quality, and full sandboxed coverage pass. Exact final suite is 380 files and 6,437 tests at 100% statements (44,702/44,702), branches (31,811/31,811), functions (9,149/9,149), and lines (43,418/43,418)."
